# SHERLOCK R13 — B5: deny access to bundler sourcemaps in production.
# Sourcemaps can be useful for Sentry, but should not be public on the CDN.
# SHERLOCK R14 — M14: target /404.html (now exists in public/) instead of
# /404 which had no actual destination → Cloudflare Pages was serving the
# SPA fallback instead of a real 404.
/assets/*.map  /404.html  404

# SPA fallback — last rule, lowest priority.
/*  /index.html  200
